# m2_hit: start at 30, then no input. Since M7 a wasp of the stage-1 vee charges and rams the
# idle ship at update 524 (game tick 494; until M7 the 8 s beetle's spread hit at 748): REWIND
# for 80 updates (bug report 20 + playback 60), resume at 604 with game_tick 374 (= hit - 120)
# and the score of that earlier tick (0: the ship never fires), rewinds 3 -> 2. The idle ship
# replays the same fate: second hit at 724 (rewinds 1), third at 924 (rewinds 0).
--frames 1000 --dump-exports debug_state,debug_rewinds,debug_game_tick,debug_score --at "523 debug_state == 1" --at "523 debug_game_tick == 493" --at "524 debug_state == 4" --at "524 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "524 debug_game_tick == 494" --at "524 debug_rewind_target == 374" --at "603 debug_state == 4" --at "604 debug_state == 1" --at "604 debug_game_tick == 374" --at "604 debug_score == 0" --at "724 debug_state == 4" --at "724 debug_rewinds == 1" --at "724 debug_rewind_target == 374" --at "924 debug_state == 4" --at "924 debug_rewinds == 0" --at "700 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 4"
